  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Watching The Bubbles In My Beer**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Ride Old Buck To Water**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **I'm Walking**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Saucy Song**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Just Right Away**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Richland Woman Blues**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Baby Won't You Whirl Me Around**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Why You Been Gone So Long**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2023-09-23.Soapbox** (recommended): source not stated; 17 songs; 103 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: banter/Billy Strings [1]\n- Mics sat about nine feet up beside a large beam or pole near the outer edge of the tent [1]\n- Night two had less wind and better music volume thanks to added speakers; background chatter still gave a cocktail-party feel like the night before [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2023-09-23.Soapbox**: taped by discocape; transferred by discocape; source: Beyerdynamic mc 930's [1]. Also: Taped, tracked and transferred by discocape using Beyerdynamic mc 930 mics in ORTF, Mogami gold XLR cable, into a Zoom H8 at 24/48 [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings 2023-09-23 Renewal Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/2023-09-23-renewal-regular/) [3]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings 2023-09-23 Renewal Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/2023-09-23-renewal-regular/) [4]",
